cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HealthGraphBench, cite this v0.2.0 benchmark release."
title: "HealthGraphBench: Incremental relational value in health-regulatory prediction"
authors:
  - name: "HealthGraphBench contributors"
version: 0.2.0
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/carabistouflette/HealthGraphBench"
url: "https://github.com/carabistouflette/HealthGraphBench/releases/tag/v0.2.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22796551"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Temporal benchmark of incremental relational value in FDA MAUDE, CMS
  nursing-home inspection, and CMS Medicare Part D prescriber-drug tasks, with
  interpretable relational heuristics, learned relational baselines, and
  task-local held-out evaluation. Evaluation periods were inspected during
  development; results are not untouched prospective confirmation.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - temporal evaluation
  - relational learning
  - public health
